T1  - Microcirculation, Adiposity, and Traditional and Emerging Cardiovascular Risk Factors in Prepubertal Children.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1210/js.2017-00130
A1  - Bastos da Cunha, Carolina
A1  - Sicuro, Fernando
A1  - Maranhao, Priscila Alves
A1  - Borges, Marcos Antonio
A1  - Cyrino, Fatima Z
