T1  - Early menarche is associated with an increased risk of type 2 diabetes in rural Chinese women and is partially mediated by BMI: the Henan Rural Cohort Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/GME.0000000000001385
A1  - Zhang, Lulu
A1  - Li, Yuqian
A1  - Wang, Chongjian
A1  - Mao, Zhenxing
