T1  - Heterogeneity in risk factors for ductal and lobular breast carcinomas: A case-control study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/ijc.32182
A1  - Dianatinasab, Mostafa
A1  - Fararouei, Mohammad
A1  - Daneshi, Nima
A1  - Rezaian, Shahab
