T1  - Higher luteinizing hormone levels associated with antimullerian hormone in postmenarchal daughters of women with polycystic ovary syndrome.
T3  - Comment in: Fertil Steril. 2019 Feb;111(2):264-265<ovid:br/> PMID: 30598169 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/30598169]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.fertnstert.2018.10.011
A1  - Crisosto, Nicolas
A1  - Ladron de Guevara, Amanda
A1  - Echiburu, Barbara
A1  - Maliqueo, Manuel
A1  - Cavada, Gabriel
