T1  - Menstrual and reproductive factors and type 2 diabetes risk: The Japan Public Health Center-based Prospective Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/jdi.12853
A1  - Nanri, Akiko
A1  - Mizoue, Tetsuya
