T1  - Deficits in Bone Geometry in Growth Hormone-Deficient Prepubertal Boys Revealed by High-Resolution Peripheral Quantitative Computed Tomography.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1159/000506229
A1  - Baer, Tamar G
A1  - Agarwal, Sanchita
A1  - Chen, Shaoxuan
A1  - Chiuzan, Codruta
A1  - Sopher, Aviva B
