T1  - beta-Cell function in obese children and adolescents with metabolic syndrome compared to isolated obesity.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/pedi.12905
A1  - Li, Guo-Hua
A1  - Chen, Xue-Feng
A1  - Liang, Xin-Yi
A1  - Lin, Hu
