T1  - Insulin metabolism markers are predictors of subclinical atherosclerosis among overweight and obese children and adolescents.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12887-018-1347-9
A1  - Asghari, Golaleh
A1  - Dehghan, Pooneh
A1  - Mirmiran, Parvin
A1  - Yuzbashian, Emad
