T1  - Resistin levels are not associated with obesity in central precocious puberty.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.peptides.2018.09.009
A1  - Zurita-Cruz, Jessie N
A1  - Medina-Bravo, Patricia
A1  - Manuel-Apolinar, Leticia
A1  - Damasio-Santana, Leticia
A1  - Wakida-Kusunoki, Guillermo
