T1  - Phthalate exposure and childhood overweight and obesity: Urinary metabolomic evidence.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.envint.2018.09.001
A1  - Xia, Bin
A1  - Zhu, Qingyang
A1  - Zhao, Yingya
