T1  - Reliability of clonidine testing for the diagnosis of growth hormone deficiency in children and adolescents.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/cen.13845
A1  - Ibba, Anastasia
A1  - Guzzetti, Chiara
A1  - Casula, Letizia
