T1  - Measurement of selected androgens using liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry in reproductive-age women with Type 1 diabetes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/humrep/dey243
A1  - Gunness, A
A1  - Pazderska, A
A1  - Ahmed, M
A1  - McGowan, A
A1  - Phelan, N
A1  - Boran, G
A1  - Taylor, A E
A1  - O'Reilly, M W
