T1  - Associations of Dehydroepiandrosterone Sulfate With Cardiometabolic Risk Factors in Prepubertal Children.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1210/jc.2018-00184
A1  - Mantyselka, Aino
A1  - Lindi, Virpi
A1  - Viitasalo, Anna
