T1  - Female reproductive history and risk of type 2 diabetes: A prospective analysis of 126 721 women.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/dom.13336
A1  - Pandeya, Nirmala
A1  - Huxley, Rachel R
A1  - Chung, Hsin-Fang
A1  - Dobson, Annette J
A1  - Kuh, Diana
