T1  - Low-grade inflammation and muscular fitness on insulin resistance in adolescents: Results from LabMed Physical Activity Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/pedi.12607
A1  - Agostinis-Sobrinho, Cesar A
A1  - Ramirez-Velez, Robinson
A1  - Garcia-Hermoso, Antonio
A1  - Moreira, Carla
A1  - Lopes, Luis
