T1  - The effect of impaired glucose metabolism on weight loss in multidisciplinary childhood obesity treatment.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/pedi.12605
A1  - Kloppenborg, Julie T
A1  - Gamborg, Michael
A1  - Fonvig, Cilius E
A1  - Nielsen, Tenna R H
A1  - Pedersen, Oluf
