T1  - IGF-1R mRNA expression is increased in obese children.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.ghir.2017.11.001
A1  - Ricco, Rafaela Cristina
A1  - Ricco, Rubens Garcia
A1  - Queluz, Mariangela Carletti
A1  - de Paula, Mariana Teresa Sarti
A1  - Atique, Patricia Volpon
