T1  - Metformin for Obesity in Prepubertal and Pubertal Children: A Randomized Controlled Trial.
T3  - Comment in: Pediatrics. 2017 Jul;140(1):<ovid:br/> PMID: 28759418 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/28759418]<ovid:br/> <ovid:br/>Erratum in: Pediatrics. 2017 Nov;140(5):<ovid:br/> PMID: 29089408 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/29089408]<ovid:br/> <ovid:br/>Comment in: Pediatrics. 2017 Dec;140(6):<ovid:br/> PMID: 29192003 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/29192003]<ovid:br/> <ovid:br/>Erratum in: Pediatrics. 2017 Nov 30;:<ovid:br/> PMID: 29192008 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/29192008]<ovid:br/> <ovid:br/>Comment in: Pediatrics. 2017 Dec;140(6):<ovid:br/> PMID: 29192009 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/29192009]<ovid:br/> <ovid:br/>Comment in: MMW Fortschr Med. 2018 Nov;160(19):38<ovid:br/> PMID: 30406534 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/30406534]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1542/peds.2016-4285
A1  - Pastor-Villaescusa, Belen
A1  - Canete, M Dolores
A1  - Caballero-Villarraso, Javier
A1  - Hoyos, Raul
