T1  - High Prevalence of Polycystic Ovary Syndrome in Type 1 Diabetes Mellitus Adolescents: Is There a Difference Depending on the NIH and Rotterdam Criteria?.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1159/000471805
A1  - Busiah, Kanetee
A1  - Colmenares, Ana
A1  - Bidet, Maud
A1  - Tubiana-Rufi, Nadia
A1  - Levy-Marchal, Claire
A1  - Delcroix, Christine
A1  - Jacquin, Paul
A1  - Martin, Delphine
A1  - Benadjaoud, Lila
A1  - Jacqz-Aigrain, Evelyne
