T3  - Comment in: J Clin Endocrinol Metab. 2017 Jul 1;102(7):2560<ovid:br/> PMID: 28899075 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/28899075]<ovid:br/> <ovid:br/>Comment in: J Clin Endocrinol Metab. 2017 Jul 1;102(7):2561<ovid:br/> PMID: 28899078 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/28899078]
