T1  - Age at menarche is associated with the prevalence of non-alcoholic fatty liver disease later in life.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/1753-0407.12379
A1  - Lu, Jieli
A1  - Zhang, Jie
A1  - Du, Rui
A1  - Wang, Tiange
A1  - Xu, Min
