T1  - Visceral fat thickness and its associations with pubertal and metabolic parameters among girls with precocious puberty.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.6065/apem.2018.23.2.81
A1  - Kim, Dong Wook
A1  - Suh, Junghwan
A1  - Kwon, Ah Reum
