T1  - Chronic disease outcomes after severe acute malnutrition in Malawian children (ChroSAM): a cohort study.
T3  - Comment in: Lancet Glob Health. 2016 Sep;4(9):e590-1<ovid:br/> PMID: 27470176 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/27470176]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S2214-109X(16)30133-4
A1  - Lelijveld, Natasha
A1  - Seal, Andrew
A1  - Wells, Jonathan C
A1  - Kirkby, Jane
A1  - Opondo, Charles
A1  - Chimwezi, Emmanuel
A1  - Bunn, James
A1  - Bandsma, Robert
A1  - Heyderman, Robert S
A1  - Nyirenda, Moffat J
