T1  - Longitudinal associations of lifestyle factors and weight status with insulin resistance (HOMA-IR) in preadolescent children: the large prospective cohort study IDEFICS.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12966-016-0424-4
A1  - Peplies, Jenny
