T1  - Clonidine-stimulated growth hormone concentrations (cut-off values) measured by immunochemiluminescent assay (ICMA) in children and adolescents with short stature.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.6061/clinics/2016(04)09
A1  - Borges, Maria de Fatima
A1  - Teixeira, Flavia Carolina Candida
