T1  - Cardiopulmonary Dysfunction and Adiponectin in Adolescents With Type 2 Diabetes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1161/JAHA.115.002804
A1  - Bjornstad, Petter
A1  - Truong, Uyen
A1  - Dorosz, Jennifer L
A1  - Cree-Green, Melanie
A1  - Baumgartner, Amy
