T1  - Serum Amino Acid Profiles in Childhood Predict Triglyceride Level in Adulthood: A 7-Year Longitudinal Study in Girls.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1210/jc.2016-1053
A1  - Wiklund, Petri
