T1  - Developmental Programming: Impact of Gestational Steroid and Metabolic Milieus on Adiposity and Insulin Sensitivity in Prenatal Testosterone-Treated Female Sheep.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1210/en.2015-1565
A1  - Cardoso, Rodolfo C
A1  - Veiga-Lopez, Almudena
A1  - Moeller, Jacob
