T1  - Age at Menarche and Cardiometabolic Risk in Adulthood: The Coronary Artery Risk Development in Young Adults Study.
T3  - Comment in: J Pediatr. 2015 Aug;167(2):225-7. doi: 10.1016/j.jpeds.2015.05.014<ovid:br/> PMID: 26051971 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/26051971]
