T1  - Growth hormone and the risk of atherosclerosis in growth hormone-deficient children.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.ghir.2015.08.005
A1  - Binay, Cigdem
A1  - Simsek, Enver
A1  - Yildirim, Ali
