T1  - A Longitudinal Study of Growth, Sex Steroids, and IGF-1 in Boys With Physiological Gynecomastia.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1210/jc.2015-2836
A1  - Mieritz, Mikkel G
A1  - Raket, Lars L
A1  - Hagen, Casper P
A1  - Nielsen, John E
A1  - Talman, Maj-Lis M
