T1  - Growth and hormone profiling in children with congenital melanocytic naevi.
T3  - Comment in: Br J Dermatol. 2015 Dec;173(6):1366-7<ovid:br/> PMID: 26708545 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/26708545]<ovid:br/> <ovid:br/>Erratum in: Br J Dermatol. 2016 Jul;175(1):226-7<ovid:br/> PMID: 27484278 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/27484278]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/bjd.14091
A1  - Waelchli, R
A1  - Williams, J
A1  - Cole, T
A1  - Dattani, M
A1  - Hindmarsh, P
