T1  - Antioxidation improves in puberty in normal weight and obese boys, in positive association with exercise-stimulated growth hormone secretion.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/pr.2015.85
A1  - Paltoglou, George
A1  - Fatouros, Ioannis G
A1  - Valsamakis, George
A1  - Schoina, Maria
A1  - Avloniti, Alexandra
