T1  - Lipid and glucose alterations in perinatally-acquired HIV-infected adolescents and young adults.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12879-015-0853-8
A1  - Blazquez, Daniel
A1  - Ramos-Amador, Jose Tomas
A1  - Sainz, Talia
A1  - Mellado, Maria Jose
A1  - Garcia-Ascaso, Marta
A1  - De Jose, Maria Isabel
A1  - Rojo, Pablo
