T1  - Pulmonary function in children with type 1 diabetes mellitus.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1515/jpem-2014-0147
A1  - Martin-Frias, Maria
A1  - Lamas, Adelaida
A1  - Lara, Emma
A1  - Alonso, Milagros
A1  - Ros, Purificacion
