T1  - Percentiles of fasting serum insulin, glucose, HbA1c and HOMA-IR in pre-pubertal normal weight European children from the IDEFICS cohort.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/ijo.2014.134
A1  - Peplies, J
A1  - Jimenez-Pavon, D
