T1  - Associations of prenatal growth with metabolic syndrome, insulin resistance, and nutritional status in Chilean children.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1155/2014/472017
A1  - Mardones, Francisco
A1  - Arnaiz, Pilar
A1  - Pacheco, Paz
