T1  - Plasma resistin levels are associated with homocysteine, endothelial activation, and nitrosative stress in obese youths.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.clinbiochem.2013.10.021
A1  - Codoner-Franch, Pilar
A1  - Tavarez-Alonso, Sandra
