T1  - Left ventricular dysfunction in obese children and adolescents with nonalcoholic fatty liver disease.
T3  - Comment in: Hepatology. 2014 Feb;59(2):372-4<ovid:br/> PMID: 23913480 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23913480]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/hep.26610
A1  - Pacifico, Lucia
A1  - Di Martino, Michele
A1  - De Merulis, Antonio
A1  - Bezzi, Mario
