T1  - Blunted response to a growth hormone stimulation test is associated with unfavorable cardiovascular risk factor profile in childhood cancer survivors.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/pbc.24308
A1  - Petryk, Anna
A1  - Baker, K Scott
A1  - Frohnert, Brigitte
A1  - Moran, Antoinette
