T1  - Does adenotonsillectomy alter IGF-1 and ghrelin serum levels in children with adenotonsillar hypertrophy and failure to thrive? A prospective study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.ijporl.2013.06.029
A1  - Jabbari Moghaddam, Yalda
A1  - Golzari, Samad E J
A1  - Saboktakin, Lida
