T1  - Adiponectin and hypertension in normal-weight and obese children.
T3  - Comment in: Am J Hypertens. 2013 May;26(5):717<ovid:br/> PMID: 23507578 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23507578]<ovid:br/> <ovid:br/>Comment in: Am J Hypertens. 2013 May;26(5):718<ovid:br/> PMID: 23507579 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23507579]
