T1  - High prevalence of precocious puberty and obesity in childhood narcolepsy with cataplexy.
T3  - Comment in: Sleep. 2013 Feb;36(2):161-2<ovid:br/> PMID: 23372260 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23372260]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.5665/sleep.2366
A1  - Poli, Francesca
A1  - Pizza, Fabio
