T1  - A population-based cross-sectional study of the association between facial morphology and cardiometabolic risk factors in adolescence.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/bmjopen-2013-002910
A1  - Djordjevic, Jelena
A1  - Lawlor, Debbie A
