T1  - Adipose tissue insulin resistance in peripubertal girls with first-degree family history of polycystic ovary syndrome.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.fertnstert.2012.08.025
A1  - Trottier, Andreanne
A1  - Battista, Marie-Claude
A1  - Geller, David H
