T1  - [Assessment of diastolic function in children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes mellitus - are there early signs of diabetic cardiomyopathy?].
T2  - Avaliacao da funcao diastolica em criancas e adolescentes diabeticos tipo 1 - Existem sinais precoces de miocardiopatia diabetica?
