T1  - Hypothalamic-pituitary lesions in pediatric patients: endocrine symptoms often precede neuro-ophthalmic presenting symptoms.
T3  - Comment in: J Pediatr. 2012 Nov;161(5):778-80<ovid:br/> PMID: 22727873 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/22727873]
