T1  - Changes in treatment adherence and glycemic control during the transition to adolescence in type 1 diabetes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2337/dc11-2163
A1  - Rausch, Joseph R
A1  - Hood, Korey K
A1  - Delamater, Alan
