T1  - Pubertal timing and growth influences cardiometabolic risk factors in adult males and females.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2337/dc11-1365
A1  - Widen, Elisabeth
A1  - Silventoinen, Karri
A1  - Sovio, Ulla
A1  - Ripatti, Samuli
