T1  - Obesity is associated with insulin resistance and components of the metabolic syndrome in Lebanese adolescents.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3109/03014460.2012.655776
A1  - Nasreddine, Lara
A1  - Naja, Farah
A1  - Tabet, Maya
