T1  - The role of pro/anti-inflammatory adipokines on bone metabolism in NAFLD obese adolescents: effects of long-term interdisciplinary therapy.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s12020-012-9613-3
A1  - Campos, Raquel M S
A1  - de Piano, Aline
A1  - da Silva, Patricia L
A1  - Carnier, June
A1  - Sanches, Priscila L
