T1  - Muscular strength and markers of insulin resistance in European adolescents: the HELENA Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00421-011-2216-5
A1  - Jimenez-Pavon, D
A1  - Ortega, F B
A1  - Valtuena, J
