T1  - Diet, physical, and biochemical characteristics of children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes: relationship between dietary fat and glucose control.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/j.1399-5448.2011.00781.x
A1  - Maffeis, Claudio
A1  - Morandi, Anita
A1  - Ventura, Emily
