T1  - Associations of physical activity and fitness with adipocytokines in adolescents: the AFINOS Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.numecd.2010.07.010
A1  - Martinez-Gomez, D
A1  - Eisenmann, J C
A1  - Gomez-Martinez, S
