T1  - Comparison of response to 2-years' growth hormone treatment in children with isolated growth hormone deficiency, born small for gestational age, idiopathic short stature, or multiple pituitary hormone deficiency: combined results from two large observational studies.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/1687-9856-2012-22
A1  - Lee, Peter A
A1  - Savendahl, Lars
A1  - Oliver, Isabelle
A1  - Tauber, Maithe
A1  - Blankenstein, Oliver
A1  - Ross, Judith
A1  - Snajderova, Marta
