T1  - Fatness, fitness, and cardiometabolic risk factors among sixth-grade youth.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1249/MSS.0b013e3181d322c4
A1  - Jago, Russell
A1  - Drews, Kimberly L
A1  - McMurray, Robert G
