T1  - High normal fasting glucose level in obese youth: a marker for insulin resistance and beta cell dysregulation.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00125-010-1693-0
A1  - O'Malley, G
A1  - Santoro, N
A1  - Northrup, V
A1  - D'Adamo, E
