T1  - Physical activity attenuates the effect of low birth weight on insulin resistance in adolescents: findings from two observational studies.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2337/db10-1670
A1  - Ortega, Francisco B
A1  - Ruiz, Jonatan R
