T1  - Prevalence of metabolic syndrome in obese children and adolescents using three different criteria and evaluation of risk factors.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.4274/jcrpe.v3i2.15
A1  - Sangun, Ozlem
A1  - Dundar, Bumin
A1  - Kosker, Muhammet
