T1  - Ethnic differences in body fat distribution among Asian pre-pubertal children: a cross-sectional multicenter study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/1471-2458-11-500
A1  - Liu, Ailing
A1  - Byrne, Nuala M
A1  - Kagawa, Masaharu
A1  - Ma, Guansheng
A1  - Kijboonchoo, Kallaya
