T1  - "Menstrual irregularities in PCOS. Does it matter when it starts?".
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1055/s-0030-1269882
A1  - Livadas, S
A1  - Christou, M
A1  - Economou, F
A1  - Karachalios, A
A1  - Xyrafis, X
