T1  - Hyperinsulinemia and waist circumference in childhood metabolic syndrome.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/03.2011/JCPSP.146150
A1  - Lone, Saira Waqar
A1  - Atta, Irum
A1  - Ibrahim, Mohsina Noor
